 "QuizRunner failed on cooldown": "<div><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground shadow-sm bg-[#1E293B] border-gray-700 max-w-2xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-white\">Module 1 quiz</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-red-300 font-medium flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"></path><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"></path></svg> 0/2 (0%). Pass mark is 70%.</p><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 text-amber-400\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg>Attempts are on cooldown until LOCAL(2026-10-02T10:00:00.000Z). Review the lessons and come back.</p></div></div></div>",
