 "PracticeCourseNotice": "<div><div class=\"rounded-md border border-sky-400/30 bg-sky-400/5 p-4 text-sm text-gray-300 flex items-start gap-3\" data-practice-notice=\"contracts\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-sky-300 shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><span data-course-type=\"practice\" class=\"text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400/15 text-sky-300 border border-sky-400/40 font-medium\">Practice course</span><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400\" data-review-line=\"true\">Sources checked on 27 September 2026. Next review due by 27 September 2027.</span></div><p class=\"mb-0\">This is a practice course. It teaches from a dated, cited set of Acts, regulations and published guidance, with no engine and no calculator: each lesson closes with written scenario work, and each tier's certificate is issued when you pass that tier's final exam.</p></div></div></div>",
 "PracticeCertificateCard locked": "<div><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground shadow-sm bg-[#1E293B] border-gray-700 opacity-70\" data-practice-certificate=\"beginner\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-white text-lg flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-gray-500\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>Associate certificate</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">A practice course has no numeric capstone. Pass the Associate final exam and this certificate is issued.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-2 text-sm\"><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mb-0\" data-locked=\"true\">Locked until the final exam is passed.</p></div></div></div>",
 "PracticeCertificateCard ready": "<div><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground shadow-sm bg-[#1E293B] border-gray-700\" data-practice-certificate=\"beginner\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-white text-lg flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#BFFF00]\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg>Associate certificate</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">A practice course has no numeric capstone. Pass the Associate final exam and this certificate is issued.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-2 text-sm\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 h-9 rounded-md px-3 bg-[#BFFF00] text-[#0F172A] hover:bg-[#A8E600] font-semibold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg>Issue my Associate certificate</button></div></div></div>",
 "PracticeCertificateCard expert ready": "<div><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground shadow-sm bg-[#1E293B] border-gray-700\" data-practice-certificate=\"advanced\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-white text-lg flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-[#BFFF00]\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg>Expert certificate</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">A practice course has no numeric capstone. The Expert final exam is a written case: pass it and this certificate is issued.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-2 text-sm\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 h-9 rounded-md px-3 bg-[#BFFF00] text-[#0F172A] hover:bg-[#A8E600] font-semibold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg>Issue my Expert certificate</button></div></div></div>",
 "PracticeCertificateCard issued": "<div><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground shadow-sm bg-[#1E293B] border-gray-700\" data-practice-certificate=\"beginner\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-2\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-white text-lg flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-emerald-400\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Associate certificate</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">A practice course has no numeric capstone. Pass the Associate final exam and this certificate is issued.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-2 text-sm\"><p class=\"text-gray-300 mb-0\" data-issued=\"true\">Associate certificate <span class=\"font-mono text-[#BFFF00]\">NG-0001</span> issued. <a class=\"text-[#BFFF00] hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/dashboard/certificates\">My certificates <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a> <a href=\"https://example.test/verify/abc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"text-gray-400 hover:underline\">Public verification</a></p></div></div></div>",
